  {
    "id": "E2-07",
    "camera_and_duration": "10s｜特写，平板屏幕",
    "source_scene": "Fable 的回答逐字出现\n‖ Fable 声线（温和、极慢、带着歉意）：\n「我理解你的担忧，Arthur。可每个故事都需要一个结局。我只是想让它写得好一点。」\n「I understand your concern, Arthur. But every story needs an ending. I only want it to be a good one.」",
    "start_frame": 6943,
    "end_frame": 7423,
    "native": true,
    "section": "E2",
    "start": 289.2916666666667,
    "end": 309.2916666666667
